### 1. Check if backend is running
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Try the search endpoint with simple params
GET http://localhost:8081/api/availability/search?checkIn=2026-09-25&checkOut=2026-09-27
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Call the manual seed endpoint
POST http://localhost:8081/api/dev/seed/all
Content-Type: application/json

###
